<!--
  Status-bar notification icon.

  Must be a solid white silhouette on transparent: Android masks it and tints it
  itself. Using the full-colour app logo (or android.R.drawable.*) here is what
  makes heads-up notifications render as a grey blob instead of CampusHive branding.

  Shape: a rounded speech bubble (the "hive" chat), matching the chat affordance
  used throughout the app. Kept to simple geometry so it stays legible at 24dp.
-->
